{"2518550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Triplets Trouble!!!", "steam_appid": 2518550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "Being a single parent is hard.<br />\r\nBeing a single parent of triplets is pretty hard.<br />\r\nBeing a single parent of triplets shortly after a global pandemic is very pretty hardy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut do you know what is much, much, much harder?<br />\r\nEnduring boredom! It is almost impossible to survive!<br />\r\nAll the games have been played!<br />\r\nAll the cool books have been read!<br />\r\nAll the cartoons have been watched!<br />\r\nEverything has been done and undone, turned and turned over!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat will Kazuki, Kazumi and Kazuko, the amazing and mischievous triplets, do to continue existing in such a boring world?!", "about_the_game": "Being a single parent is hard.<br />\r\nBeing a single parent of triplets is pretty hard.<br />\r\nBeing a single parent of triplets shortly after a global pandemic is very pretty hardy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut do you know what is much, much, much harder?<br />\r\nEnduring boredom! It is almost impossible to survive!<br />\r\nAll the games have been played!<br />\r\nAll the cool books have been read!<br />\r\nAll the cartoons have been watched!<br />\r\nEverything has been done and undone, turned and turned over!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat will Kazuki, Kazumi and Kazuko, the amazing and mischievous triplets, do to continue existing in such a boring world?!", "short_description": "Triplets Trouble!!! is a visual novel slice of life about a father and his triplets in a period shortly after the pandemic. Each game played by the children became a mini-game, in a short narrative over seven days in the life of this family.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/251855